# Up the Spout! (levels/solo/spout.txt): two tries up the tower. Format: src/capture/timeline.rs.
# 1. Into the duck shaft and let it carry Nat up, smashing the soap bricks... and out of the
#    trap door on the left: brushes.
wait 0.3
hold Right 0.9
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 2.5
wait 3
# 2. Eight bars later (the beat bridge keeps time with the music): up the shaft again (the
#    bricks stay smashed), a toot holding right just under the trap door, out of the real door
#    against the backboard, the fans up, the beat bridge (blue, red, blue), the chimney: toot
#    off the ducks and out over the top onto the plunger.
at 10.3
hold Right 0.9
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 2.5
hold Right Space 150ms
hold Right 0.7
wait 1.2
hold Right 0.4
wait 0.4
hold Right 0.35
wait 1.0
hold Right 0.4
at 21.0
hold Left Space 250ms
hold Left 0.35
at 22.25
hold Left Space 250ms
hold Left 0.15
at 23.5
hold Left Space 250ms
hold Left 0.15
at 24.75
hold Left Space 250ms
hold Left 0.3
at 25.8
hold Left 0.5
hold Left Space 300ms
hold Left 0.6
repeat 3
hold Left Space 100ms
hold Left 0.4
end
hold Right 1.5
wait 2
